Local modification of @corbits/mcp 0.4.1 (LGPL-2.1-only, https://github.com/corbitsdev/corbits-mcp).
Lets an operator mark an MCP server as confined so its destructiveHint tools on allowWithoutAsk skip the ask floor.
Offered under LGPL-2.1-only; see THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.

